{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>That your days may be multiplied and the days of your children.</b> If you do so, they will be multiplied; and if not, they will not be multiplied — for words of Torah are inferred from the negative to the positive and from the positive to the negative (Sifrei)." "<b>To give them.</b> It is not written here 'to give you,' but 'to give them' — from here the Sages derive the resurrection of the dead from the Torah."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:36.581529917Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}